/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   1. STYLE DIMENSIONS
 
   Four ways of working that cut ACROSS tracks:
     people    +2 stakeholder-facing    -2 heads-down
     verify    +2 proving / checking    -2 creating new
     ops       +2 owns running systems  -2 project work, no pager
     breadth   +2 many contexts fast    -2 one system deeply
   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */
 
